        "image_alt": "Story image",
        "heading": "Every Woman Deserves Comfort Without Compromise",
        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<p>After 15 years in swimwear design, our founder Angela was done watching women struggle with inserts that slipped, bunched, and fell apart. So she built the first patented non-slip bra insert—designed to stay put without adhesives or constant adjusting.</p><p>When women recovering from mastectomies reached out for lighter alternatives to heavy, uncomfortable breast forms, we expanded. Working alongside breast health nurses and professional bra fitters, we created lightweight, breathable post-op solutions designed with real bodies and real life in mind.</p><p>At Honey Cloudz, we listen closely, design with intention, and never stop improving.</p>",
        "link_label": "Learn More About Our Story",
        "link_url": "shopify://pages/about-us",
        "image_radius": 30,
        "gap": 64,
        "padding_top": 64,
        "padding_bottom": 64
      }
    },
